---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftTaxonomyDefect
---
Construct a TaxonomyDefect draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Analyze repeated fit problems to identify structural defects. Separate insufficient annotation guidance from real conceptual change, inspect negative examples, and avoid proliferating categories for every rare wording variant.
